        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"99d60707-c4c0-4458-82c4-5f5255bd067a\",\"review_text\":\"So good app I love it and I love music\"},{\"review_id\":\"815da4eb-5547-413d-8562-6d912a7ed519\",\"review_text\":\"New update is pathetic. The only issue is we can't listen music on music application. We can do all things on this app but can't listen music ... There are 1000ads between songs and if you want to listen one line again ... By escaping ads your mood is fresh and listening good music and want to listen one line again ...#premium time 🙂 wow uninstalling this and trying some other music application in which we can peacefully listen music\"},{\"review_id\":\"4086db50-fefe-4d85-8d7c-497b17a985a7\",\"review_text\":\"The updates suck for like a month Everytime they do it. New one is bad plus overall app is running poorly now.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2fec16d1-66d8-4e22-a7e7-e9114fa68f31\",\"review_text\":\"Super spotify nice all song in app nice app\"},{\"review_id\":\"0a4c42cb-9cbf-4490-86bc-3b78003663cf\",\"review_text\":\"It is the wrost app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3d565470-e7dd-4702-809e-f73a662e8ff4\",\"review_text\":\"love this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"ee983e94-fcf6-47f2-bb23-25b202e0a804\",\"review_text\":\"Its a really good app except the inability for users to download songs for offline use...... Really sad\"},{\"review_id\":\"f7a56023-2773-4821-a2cc-37b936c9a1e2\",\"review_text\":\"Under His Hoodie by bratmindjonaxxAilurophile (a cat lover)Trust the timing of your life:)\"},{\"review_id\":\"665700c2-bd10-4d1d-be93-4edfb7e64443\",\"review_text\":\"I don't like how spotify doesn't play the songs i want on shuffle playlist or even when i play some other playlists it plays the songs from previous playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f9214d6-7b53-4c2c-aee2-72aa80b0f587\",\"review_text\":\"Down this app ratings\"}]}"
